      "chunk_id": "text_14",
      "quote": "D1: Bias arising from the randomization process. D2: Bias due to deviations from intended intervention. D3: Bias due to missing outcome data. D4: Bias in measurement of the outcome. D5: Bias in selection of the reported result.",
      "reason": "The domains assessed by the RoB 2 tool are explicitly listed in the legend of Figure 2 (chunk text_14)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_11_e3",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_19",
      "quote": "Consequently, the overall risk of bias was rated as high by the algorithm, which defines the overall risk as high if at least one domain is judged to be at high risk.",
      "reason": "The manuscript reports that an overall judgment was made and specifies the algorithm/rule used to derive it."
    },
    {
